{
  "displayName": "NavCare canary: __SERVICE__",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "How to read this dashboard (__SERVICE__)",
          "text": {
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "content": "- Each point covers the 10 minutes before it (one canary step): read a step at its end time. No traffic shows a gap, not a pass.\n- Counts come from PromQL `increase()`, which extrapolates and can be fractional (for example 19.6 or 1.2), so the 20-request and 1-failure lines are approximate. The step check (`loadtest/step_check.py`) counts log lines exactly and makes the decision.\n- Went to v2: engine `v2` or `v1_fallback`. A v2 failure: `v1_fallback`, or `v2` with status 500. 503s are left out of criteria 1 and 3 (docs/canary.md).\n- Cost is an *estimated model-token cost* (Gemini only, no Routes or Cloud Run) over every line that went to v2, as criterion 6 says. A 503 or 500 on v2 may follow paid Gemini calls but logs no usage, so its cost is unknown, as is a failed or token-less model call. The known average is always drawn: as *complete* when nothing in the step is unknown, otherwise as *INCOMPLETE: hold*, which is not a pass. Unknown counts by status are next to it.\n- Criteria 2, 5 and 7 come from `results.jsonl` and the billing report, not from this dashboard."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Requests per engine (10 min)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum by (engine) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "{{engine}}",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "requests",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 16,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Share of requests that went to v2 (%)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "100 * (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\"}[10m])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "v2 share",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "%",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 16,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Criterion 1: v2 failure rate (%), shown from about 20 v2 requests",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "100 * ((sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=\"v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m])) or vector(0)) + (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=\"v2\",status=\"500\"}[10m])) or vector(0))) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m])) and on() (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m])) >= 20)"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "v2 failure rate",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "criterion 1: 5 %",
                "value": 5,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "%",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 32,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Criterion 1 (small steps): v2 failures (approx.)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "((sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=\"v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m])) or vector(0)) + (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=\"v2\",status=\"500\"}[10m])) or vector(0))) and on() (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m])) > 0)"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "v2 failures",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "fewer than 20 v2 requests: at most 1",
                "value": 1,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "failures",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 32,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Requests that went to v2 (without 503s, approx.)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___requests{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\",status!=\"503\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "went to v2",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "failure rate shown from 20",
                "value": 20,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "requests",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 48,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Criterion 3: v2 p95 latency (v2 and v1_fallback, ms)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___latency_ms_bucket{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v2|v1_fallback\"}[10m])))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "v2 p95",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "criterion 3: 30 s",
                "value": 30000,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "ms",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 48,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Criterion 4: v1 p95 latency (ms)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___latency_ms_bucket{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\",engine=~\"v1\"}[10m])))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "v1 p95",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "criterion 4: 5 s",
                "value": 5000,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "ms",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 64,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Criterion 6: estimated model-token cost per v2 request (USD, known estimates)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "(sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_usd_sum{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_usd_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))) and on() ((sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_unknown{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) or vector(0)) == 0)"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "complete: every estimate known",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              },
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "(sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_usd_sum{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_usd_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))) and on() (sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_unknown{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) > 0)"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "INCOMPLETE: hold (some estimates unknown)",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "label": "criterion 6: $0.05",
                "value": 0.05,
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "USD",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 24,
        "yPos": 64,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Cost estimates: known vs unknown by status (requests that went to v2)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_usd_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "known",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              },
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum by (status) (increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___model_cost_unknown{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "unknown, status {{status}}",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "requests",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 80,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Average tokens per v2 request",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___prompt_tokens_sum{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___prompt_tokens_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "prompt",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              },
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "prometheusQuery": "sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___output_tokens_sum{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m])) / sum(increase(logging_googleapis_com:user___PREFIX___output_tokens_count{monitored_resource=\"cloud_run_revision\"}[10m]))"
                },
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "legendTemplate": "output",
                "targetAxis": "Y1"
              }
            ],
            "thresholds": [],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "tokens",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
